    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331090/extras/5bbb0f55ecbbb8d34ddd414a29b88cbf.avif?t=1755618665\" width=1500 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A world under the effective rule of the great organization &quot;Salt and Glass&quot; and their ideology of peace. In this dystopia, a young boy named Harasa, who was on the verge of death, was fortunate enough to find a job.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">He spent his days earning salt to survive by picking up trash in the Garden. There, he met a fairy girl with beautiful red hair. She seemed to be searching for something. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A story set in motion by this encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Will it change this dim world, or will it all just scatter in vain?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331090/extras/433324860ae276b2299c65c8dae36152.webp?t=1755618665\" width=900 height=1 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\u25bc\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 System\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u25bc</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331090/extras/433324860ae276b2299c65c8dae36152.webp?t=1755618665\" width=900 height=1 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25c6 </strong> <strong>Parkour action in the randamly generated field</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every time the game starts, the field changes to test your improvisation skills. Run through, jump around, and land perfectly on the complex fields that are generated one after another.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331090/extras/84853615fe4799d7f2e564417362ed68.poster.avif?t=1755618665\" width=780 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331090/extras/84853615fe4799d7f2e564417362ed68.webm?t=1755618665\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331090/extras/84853615fe4799d7f2e564417362ed68.mp4?t=1755618665\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2666\u00a0<strong>Weaponize fall damage</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can weaponize catastrophic fall damage to active Anti-impact that blow away the enemies. If you success in landing, your energy to fight is stocked and you can attack again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25c6 Shoot, slash, hunt enemies, and make a perfect landing from a super drop!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat the insects that stand in your way. You can replenish your energy by landing. Alternate between landing and attacking to burn the annoying insects to ashes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331090/extras/6b1954e0a79c368966c893f2c04f6e6c.poster.avif?t=1755618665\" width=780 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331090/extras/6b1954e0a79c368966c893f2c04f6e6c.webm?t=1755618665\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331090/extras/6b1954e0a79c368966c893f2c04f6e6c.mp4?t=1755618665\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25c6\u00a0Customize your robot using cores obtained from insects</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strange bugging insects live in the garden. Get rid of them disturbing your work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2666\u00a0<strong>Parkour action in the randamly generated field</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every time the game starts, the field changes to test your improvisation skills. Run through, jump around, and land perfectly on the complex fields that are generated one after another.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25c6 Challenge the boss</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat the powerful enemies waiting at the end of the stage and gain their power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331090/extras/8cd6516127f7fb28493a86cfcee2d152.poster.avif?t=1755618665\" width=780 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331090/extras/8cd6516127f7fb28493a86cfcee2d152.webm?t=1755618665\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331090/extras/8cd6516127f7fb28493a86cfcee2d152.mp4?t=1755618665\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331090/extras/5bbb0f55ecbbb8d34ddd414a29b88cbf.avif?t=1755618665\" width=1500 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A world under the effective rule of the great organization &quot;Salt and Glass&quot; and their ideology of peace. In this dystopia, a young boy named Harasa, who was on the verge of death, was fortunate enough to find a job.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">He spent his days earning salt to survive by picking up trash in the Garden. There, he met a fairy girl with beautiful red hair. She seemed to be searching for something. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A story set in motion by this encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Will it change this dim world, or will it all just scatter in vain?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331090/extras/433324860ae276b2299c65c8dae36152.webp?t=1755618665\" width=900 height=1 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\u25bc\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 System\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u25bc</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331090/extras/433324860ae276b2299c65c8dae36152.webp?t=1755618665\" width=900 height=1 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25c6 </strong> <strong>Parkour action in the randamly generated field</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every time the game starts, the field changes to test your improvisation skills. Run through, jump around, and land perfectly on the complex fields that are generated one after another.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331090/extras/84853615fe4799d7f2e564417362ed68.poster.avif?t=1755618665\" width=780 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331090/extras/84853615fe4799d7f2e564417362ed68.webm?t=1755618665\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331090/extras/84853615fe4799d7f2e564417362ed68.mp4?t=1755618665\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2666\u00a0<strong>Weaponize fall damage</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can weaponize catastrophic fall damage to active Anti-impact that blow away the enemies. If you success in landing, your energy to fight is stocked and you can attack again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25c6 Shoot, slash, hunt enemies, and make a perfect landing from a super drop!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat the insects that stand in your way. You can replenish your energy by landing. Alternate between landing and attacking to burn the annoying insects to ashes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331090/extras/6b1954e0a79c368966c893f2c04f6e6c.poster.avif?t=1755618665\" width=780 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331090/extras/6b1954e0a79c368966c893f2c04f6e6c.webm?t=1755618665\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331090/extras/6b1954e0a79c368966c893f2c04f6e6c.mp4?t=1755618665\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25c6\u00a0Customize your robot using cores obtained from insects</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strange bugging insects live in the garden. Get rid of them disturbing your work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2666\u00a0<strong>Parkour action in the randamly generated field</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every time the game starts, the field changes to test your improvisation skills. Run through, jump around, and land perfectly on the complex fields that are generated one after another.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25c6 Challenge the boss</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat the powerful enemies waiting at the end of the stage and gain their power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331090/extras/8cd6516127f7fb28493a86cfcee2d152.poster.avif?t=1755618665\" width=780 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331090/extras/8cd6516127f7fb28493a86cfcee2d152.webm?t=1755618665\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331090/extras/8cd6516127f7fb28493a86cfcee2d152.mp4?t=1755618665\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
